    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2457" root="بزر" body-key="b">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزَرَ القِدْرَ</span></b> , (Msb,) [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزُرَ</span></b>  or 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزِرَ</span></b> , accord. to the
rule of the K,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزْرٌ</span>; (K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بزّرها</span></b> ,
(A,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْزِيرٌ</span>; (TA;) <i>He threw,</i> or <i>put,</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْزَار</span>, (A,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِبْزَار</span>, (Msb,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبَازِير</span>, (A, K,)
[i. e. <i>seeds for seasoning the food,</i>] <i>into the
cooking-pot.</i> (A, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بزّر</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَامَهُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He seasoned</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْبَلَ</span> [meaning <i>he embel-lished</i>]) <i>his speech,</i> or <i>language.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزَرَ</span>,
(TK,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزْرٌ</span>, (K,) also signifies <i>He sowed</i>
(K, TK) seeds; (TK;) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَرَ</span>. (K, TA.)

